exact HEAD 36caafd7a09d: mixed Flex/location/text=1 POST; observer fault: batch 400, Flex retry 200, text retry 200; receipt parts=[proof-msg-2-1, proof-msg-3-1]
exact HEAD later-batch fault: five-message batch 200, text+image batch 400, text retry 200, image retry 400; six unique accepted IDs
negative controls: plain text=1 POST; media-only=1 POST
```

